# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> X(Lambda_c nbar) l- nu] dummy-resonant gap mode, e and mu, cc
# NickName: B0_LcNlnu_dummyres_gapmodes
# Documentation: B0 -> Lambda_c anti-n l nu via wide dummy resonance (m=3.8 GeV, w=3.0 GeV),
#   isospin partner of decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/LcPenu (B+ -> Lambda_c pbar l nu). Standard
#   literature pairing for this baryonic semileptonic channel: the spectator antiquark that ends
#   up in the light (anti)baryon is u-bar for B+ (giving pbar = u-bar u-bar d-bar) and d-bar for
#   B0 (giving nbar = u-bar d-bar d-bar), with the same Lambda_c+ on the charm side either way.
#   Confirmed with the analysis author (2026-08-31).
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias LcN0sig D_0*+
Alias anti-LcN0sig D_0*-
ChargeConj LcN0sig anti-LcN0sig

Particle LcN0sig      3.8 3.0
Particle anti-LcN0sig 3.8 3.0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 LcN0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 LcN0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay LcN0sig
1.0 Lambda_c+ anti-n0 PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-LcN0sig

Decay Lambda_c+
1.00  p+  K-  pi+  PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-Lambda_c-

End
